WEBVTT

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:03.690
<i>Shuta is able to take pictures of the future using the power of his Number.</i>

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:05.270
<i>According to his photo,</i>

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:09.730
<i>not only I will lose the Duel in that "foreseeable" future, but the airship Kotori rode will fall as well!</i>

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:11.170
<i>Stop joking around!</i>

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:14.430
<i>I'm gonna beat you and rescue Kotori at all costs!</i>

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:19.990
<i>You only have two turns left.</i>

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:22.650
Alright, feel free to come at me!

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:26.210
Towards that future with your inevitable defeat!

00:00:27.310 --> 00:00:28.820
Kotori, I will definitely save you!

00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:31.820
Let's go! My turn, draw!

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:34.560
<i>Bye-Bye damage!</i>

00:00:35.670 --> 00:00:38.040
I Summon Achacha Archer!

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:45.450
When Achacha Archer is Summoned successfully, it can inflict 500 damage to my opponent!

00:00:50.970 --> 00:00:52.760
Sweet, I did it!

00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:56.080
Didn't I say I already saw through everything?

00:00:56.670 --> 00:00:59.820
Not only that I will receive 500 damage here,

00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:06.200
but that you will also set the Trap Card Bye-Bye Damage from your hand onto your field!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:08.960
<i>This picture is the proof!</i>

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:11.530
<i>How's that possible?</i>

00:01:11.960 --> 00:01:14.340
<i>Bye-Bye Damage is in Yuma's hand.</i>

00:01:14.620 --> 00:01:19.240
<i>When a Monster he controls is attacked, that Monster is not destroyed by battle,</i>

00:01:19.490 --> 00:01:24.720
<i>and for the battle damage Yuma received, his opponent will take twice that amount as damage!</i>

00:01:25.590 --> 00:01:28.670
<i>Indeed he is planning to set Bye-Bye Damage at this point of time.</i>

00:01:29.030 --> 00:01:32.820
Alright, just set it! You don't have a choice anyway.

00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:38.370
I set one card and end my turn!

00:01:39.340 --> 00:01:44.010
<i>If his pictures really do record the "future", then...</i>

00:01:45.090 --> 00:01:47.370
<i>...we have no chance of winning!</i>

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:51.150
<i>As I get closer, I stretch my hand out</i>

00:01:51.150 --> 00:01:54.200
<i>towards that shining light leading towards tomorrow</i>

00:01:54.370 --> 00:02:01.460
<i>I dream of a world that expands from my feet.</i>

00:02:05.210 --> 00:02:10.720
<i>I haven't a clue of where things like dreams and hopes are at.</i>

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:15.220
<i>Even if I run looking for it, I still can't seem to find it.</i>

00:02:16.180 --> 00:02:21.680
<i>I wonder if I have fallen into a gap of truth and lies.</i>

00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:26.480
<i>Even so, our grand tale has yet to begin.</i>

00:02:26.900 --> 00:02:32.150
<i>Let's move on towards tomorrow, 
even if our road begins to fall apart.</i>

00:02:32.150 --> 00:02:37.410
<i>I will jump forward, before all my
 strength completely drains.</i>

00:02:37.830 --> 00:02:40.290
<i>The closer I get, the further it becomes,</i>

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:43.580
<i>that truth that I must seize.</i>

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:48.750
<i>It's to find hope that we desire from a future unseen.</i>

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:51.340
<i>With a heart stronger than anyone else,</i>

00:02:51.550 --> 00:02:54.510
<i>I'll learn to keep running up.</i>

00:02:54.840 --> 00:03:00.060
<i>With the strength to win any battle, 
despite just how weak I am,</i>

00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:02.560
<i>My purpose is to find,</i>

00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:05.560
<i>with these invaluable friends of mine,</i>

00:03:05.560 --> 00:03:12.360
<i>The future of the world expanding
 from my feet with my own eyes.</i>

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:25.760
Kotori-<i>chan</i>, can you hear me?

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:26.970
<i>Akari-</i>san<i>!</i>

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:31.770
"Number 36: "The Power To Open A Path To The Future!
 Aspiring Emperor - Hope Ray"

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:28.390
<i>Are you injured?</i>

00:03:28.730 --> 00:03:29.890
<i>N-No...</i>

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:31.810
<i>What's happening inside the blimp?</i>

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:36.610
About that...There is lot of smoke coming out...
 the blimp is shaking, and everyone is in a panic!

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:39.940
<i>It's gonna be okay, calm yourself!</i>

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:41.950
<i>I will save you guys for sure!</i>

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:43.820
<i>Hang in there until then, got it?!</i>

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:44.820
<i>Yes!</i>

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:50.910
My turn, draw!

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:53.920
Due to Telephoto Lens' effect,

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:56.540
it will gain 400 ATK for every card in his hand.

00:03:57.170 --> 00:04:00.300
Thus Scoop Shooter's ATK is 3000!

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:02.470
If you take an attack like that...

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:06.220
Yeah... I will take 1800 points of big damage...

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:08.770
If Bye-Bye Damage will be successfully activated,

00:04:08.770 --> 00:04:12.140
then I can inflict double of that amount, 3600 points, back to that guy!

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:14.940
<i>But he will already know that...</i>

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:20.150
I activate the Magic Card, Night Shoot, from my hand!

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:21.110
What?!

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:27.530
This card can destroy one set Magic or Trap Card on my opponent's field.

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:30.620
Alright, which one should I choose?

00:04:30.950 --> 00:04:33.750
I select the card on the right side!

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:40.090
That's Bye-Bye Damage!

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:43.260
And then I Summon Scandal Sniper!

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:50.310
Then, since I have two less cards in my hand,

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:53.140
Scoop Shooter loses 800 ATK.

00:04:53.180 --> 00:04:55.600
Even so, it still has enough Attack Power to get the job done!

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:59.860
Alright, go, Scoop Shooter! Attack Achacha Archer!

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:04.360
I am not done yet!

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:07.030
I attack you directly with Scandal Sniper!

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:18.130
Then I activate Scandal Sniper's effect!

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:21.340
When it attacks successfully and inflicts damage to my opponent,

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:25.220
Scandal Sniper gains two levels and switches to Defense position!

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:29.890
After that I activate the Magic Card from my hand, Xyz Flame!

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:35.480
During your next turn, no Monster other than Xyz Monsters can declare an attack!

00:05:35.810 --> 00:05:38.060
Now all the preparations are finished!

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:41.190
Now I end my turn!

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:44.240
It's finally the fifth turn after all...

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:48.200
As this photo indicates, you will Summon Hope during the fifth turn,

00:05:48.530 --> 00:05:50.450
and lose to me in the sixth turn.

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:54.410
Who are you?

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:56.620
No one can enter here besides the authorized personnel!

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:58.210
It's an emergency!

00:05:58.670 --> 00:06:00.920
This is a matter of life and death!

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:03.630
Are you responsible for this blimp?

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:07.300
What's the current situation?

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:11.260
Well... the engine on the left side is on fire due to malfunction...

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:15.020
Plus the pilots are unconscious at the moment...

00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:16.770
Is there a remote control?

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:19.020
No, we never had that option installed...

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:20.650
Isn't there any other way to resolve it?

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:24.480
Kotori...

00:06:27.150 --> 00:06:29.110
My turn, draw!

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:31.950
That card is Gogogo Giant!

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:36.700
Right now that's the only Monster Card in your hand!

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:42.420
If you Summon Gogogo Giant successfully, you can Special Summon Gogogo Golem from your Graveyard!

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:47.920
Now you have two Level Four Monsters on your field to Summon Hope.

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:50.050
That's the only thing you can possibly do!

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:51.890
Darn it all...

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:56.720
Alright, just Summon Hope! This is your future!

00:06:59.890 --> 00:07:01.190
What's wrong, Kotori?

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:04.230
<i>The engine...the other engine too...</i>

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:11.320
Kotori!

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:14.580
Wait for me, Kotori...

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:20.040
In order to save you, I will defeat Shuta Hayami here and now!

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:23.830
Huh? What do you mean defeat Hayami-<i>senpai</i>?

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:26.250
Do you know this guy?

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:29.220
I do...but...

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:32.510
Yuma, why are you Dueling with Hayami-<i>senpai</i>?

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:35.140
He is the one who caused the whole incident!

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:41.060
He was possessed by a Number, and acquired the power to change future at his will!

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:46.190
Then he utilized that power to take scoop photos from those so-called "accidents"!

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:47.980
How... how can that be?

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:50.490
He showed it to me!

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:54.280
Before we were talking, the picture of the falling blimp!

00:07:56.870 --> 00:07:58.910
And that actually became reality!

00:07:59.200 --> 00:08:03.080
No way... My upperclassman isn't that kind of person!

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:07.960
The pictures he took were always heartwarming. They made people who looked at them feel happiness!

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:13.090
Such despicable behavior just for the sake of scoop photos...

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:14.760
<i>I don't believe this...!</i>

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:18.100
Kotori, he is no longer the Shuta Hayami you once knew!

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:22.810
Once possessed by Numbers, a human's desire will be amplified!

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:25.690
You already knew Kotori is on that blimp.

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:28.020
And you're fine with the blimp falling?

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:31.110
That was merely my imagination,

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:34.110
For me that counts as a tragedy as well.

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:35.240
Upperclassman?!

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:39.200
But my imagination will transfer into pictures without any abridgment,

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:41.910
and it is bound to become reality!

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:46.380
As much as I feel sorry for Mizuki-<i>kun</i>, that image in my mind...

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:50.050
How can I miss it as a professional photographer?

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:51.630
You can't...

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:55.470
Indeed I am different than before.

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:58.350
My soft pictures for the people...

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:02.560
I suddenly realized that scoop photos can bring a bigger impact.

00:09:02.930 --> 00:09:04.560
Ever since that day...

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:09.570
That card - that Number...

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:14.490
The moment I acquired it... I completely changed.

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:18.660
I can now shoot scoop photos at will!

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:26.290
In order to bring bigger impact to society, I need more accidental scoops!

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:31.500
A single Number card has such amazing power hidden inside.

00:09:31.590 --> 00:09:32.920
If I can collect more...

00:09:33.260 --> 00:09:36.550
I will become the number one Professional photographer in the world!

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:39.550
This is why I am participating in the Duel Carnival!

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:43.930
Every single one of them... They're all wrong!

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:48.850
Dueling isn't a tool for revenge! Nor something to fulfill your own greed!

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:51.980
You can shout all you want, but you will <i>not</i> win against me.

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:58.820
Right! You can only walk on the path I have already set for you!

00:09:59.370 --> 00:10:00.990
Stop that nonsense!

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:03.660
I should mention that I won't tolerate you surrendering.

00:10:03.990 --> 00:10:06.750
You will carry out the Duel with me until the end and lose.

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:09.790
Then I will take your Numbers away.

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:11.130
That is what's been decided.

00:10:11.340 --> 00:10:12.420
Shut up!!

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:16.420
I'm the only one who gets to decide my future!!

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:19.260
<i>You decide yourself?</i>

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:23.680
<i>I won't let a guy like you decide me and Kotori's future!</i>

00:10:23.930 --> 00:10:26.480
I Summon Gogogo Giant!

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:34.780
Right, that's how it should be!

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:37.780
Then use its Monster Effect from your Graveyard...

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:41.320
I Special Summon Gogogo Golem in Defense Position!

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:48.460
After this effect is used, Gogogo Giant will switch to Defense Position as well!

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:53.920
I guess I really have no other choice but to Summon Hope!

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:57.630
But you won't be able to escape the path he set for you doing that.

00:10:58.840 --> 00:11:01.390
Don't panic, Yuma. When in doubt, take a break.

00:11:01.720 --> 00:11:06.270
Try to find a way to counter the prediction,

00:11:06.600 --> 00:11:09.980
and you may just be able to open a path to a new future.

00:11:10.690 --> 00:11:16.070
Though I don't know what kind of path awaits you, if you deny the future he has created for you.

00:11:16.860 --> 00:11:22.160
But you're the one who said that you're the only one who gets to create your future.


00:11:23.570 --> 00:11:26.830
What's wrong? You won't accept your fate?

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:32.120
Now call out Hope.

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:33.460
Call him!

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:43.430
CALL HIM!

00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:46.220
I won't!!

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:47.010
What!?

00:11:47.260 --> 00:11:50.480
I won't move as you predicted!

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:54.980
I shall end my turn like this!

00:11:56.770 --> 00:11:58.860
I shall end my turn like this!

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:04.160
E-End your turn?

00:12:04.160 --> 00:12:06.910
What's that supposed to mean? Don't get off track!

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:09.620
These pictures are the evidence...

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:13.960
You will summon Gogogo Giant and Gogogo Golem,

00:12:14.630 --> 00:12:18.960
then Summon Number 39, Aspiring Emperor - Hope, during your fifth turn.

00:12:19.590 --> 00:12:22.680
Finally during the sixth turn, I will destroy Hope.

00:12:22.800 --> 00:12:26.470
Then, your Numbers will be mine.

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:29.930
Your future is already arranged accordingly!

00:12:30.020 --> 00:12:32.020
Those pictures have nothing to do with it!

00:12:32.730 --> 00:12:35.230
I won't ever walk on the path you have set for me!

00:12:35.980 --> 00:12:37.980
No matter what kind of future is awaiting me!

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:41.530
I will only walk on my <i>own</i> path! I decide it!

00:12:43.360 --> 00:12:44.780
Alright, it's your turn!

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:49.910
You cannot fight destiny! My turn, draw!

00:12:50.740 --> 00:12:53.410
I Summon Panic Paparazzi!

00:12:58.880 --> 00:13:02.550
Then I activate Panic Paparazzi's effect!

00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:07.090
When I release this card, Scoop Shooter gains two levels!

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:10.760
Now I have two Level Six Monsters!

00:13:11.270 --> 00:13:15.690
I overlay Scoop Shooter and Scandal Sniper!

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:21.570
With these two Monsters, I build the Overlay Network!

00:13:23.110 --> 00:13:25.110
Xyz Summon!

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:27.990
Come forth, Number 25!

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:38.580
Fullmetal Photoglide - Focus Force!

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:41.710
So here it comes! Numbers!

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:44.920
Big sis...

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:47.090
It's alright, we will be alright...

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:48.970
Yuma...

00:13:49.850 --> 00:13:51.890
Go, Focus Force!

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:54.100
Attack Gogogo Golem!

00:13:54.600 --> 00:13:57.020
Lethal Negative: Kill Shot!!

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:01.770
When Gogogo Golem is in Defense Position,

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:05.030
once per turn, it cannot be destroyed by battle!

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:09.570
Idiot! I activate Focus Force's effect!

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:14.500
Once per turn, by detaching one Overlay Unit,

00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:18.790
when my opponent's Monster activates its effect, Focus Force can negate that effect!

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:21.170
Do it, Focus Force!

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:26.840
Soul Develop!

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:34.470
How's that? This is Focus Force's power!

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:40.480
But none of this was captured in the photographs he took.

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:42.110
That's true!

00:14:43.320 --> 00:14:46.280
Hey! Why'd you go and destroy Gogogo Golem?!

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:49.610
I can't call out Hope with just Gogogo Giant!

00:14:50.860 --> 00:14:55.410
As I thought, his Dueling relies entirely on a pre-constructed path.

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:58.330
He simply moves forward without even thinking.

00:14:59.710 --> 00:15:04.210
It is true that he can capture the future on the pictures he takes using the power of the Number.

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:08.840
However, that only applies to what he visualizes after he flashes the shutter.

00:15:10.130 --> 00:15:12.550
All of the opponents he defeated up until now

00:15:12.550 --> 00:15:16.430
who were captured on his photos were told they would not be able to escape what had already been planned out.

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:19.730
It was merely a curse of words that repeated endlessly.

00:15:21.940 --> 00:15:26.280
But when you declared the end of your turn, Yuma, you broke through that curse.

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:30.450
You do not have the power to create the future through pictures!

00:15:30.740 --> 00:15:33.870
It can't be...! It's a lie! I won't accept it...

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:36.990
A future beyond my imagination!

00:15:37.240 --> 00:15:39.370
Those photos have no meaning at all!

00:15:39.830 --> 00:15:41.670
The future has already been changed!

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:46.460
He was solely relying on his Number,

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:49.720
thus it is very obvious that he hasn't sharpened his Dueling skills.

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:53.430
Yuma, this man is no match for you!

00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:59.520
But... Numbers can only be defeated by Numbers!

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:02.640
If you wish to win, then you have to Summon Hope!

00:16:03.310 --> 00:16:05.230
My turn ends now!

00:16:11.610 --> 00:16:15.160
Kotori... I am definitely going to save you!

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:18.040
Let's go! My turn, draw!

00:16:18.370 --> 00:16:20.700
I Summon Overlay Owl!

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:28.800
I activate Overlay Owl's Monster Effect!

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:33.050
By paying 600 Life Points,

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:37.970
I can send one Overlay Unit from a Xyz Monster my opponent controls to the Graveyard!

00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:39.470
I won't let you do that!

00:16:39.520 --> 00:16:44.060
When my opponent activates a Monster Effect, by detaching one Overlay Unit, that effect will...

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:47.770
Whatever you do, you will lose your Overlay Unit!

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:51.240
Oh no!!

00:16:51.780 --> 00:16:55.030
Sorry for the wait. Allow me to show you Hope you've wanted to see so badly!

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:59.740
I Overlay the Level Four Gogogo Giant and Overlay Owl!

00:17:02.660 --> 00:17:05.920
With these two Monsters, I build the Overlay Network!

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:07.960
Xyz Summon!

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:15.010
Come forth, Number 39, Aspiring Emperor - Hope!

00:17:17.720 --> 00:17:19.100
There you are... Hope!

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:22.720
This is it, Hope's ATK is 2500,

00:17:23.140 --> 00:17:27.810
But my Focus Force's ATK is 2800.
 Next turn...

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:29.730
There is no next turn for you!

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:31.110
Go, Yuma!

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:34.860
I'll bring it to 'em!

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:37.410
Chaos XYZ Change!

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:44.580
Come forth, Chaos Number 39! Aspiring Emperor - Hope Ray!

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:54.590
Hope evolved!?

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:57.550
I activate Hope Ray's Monster Effect!

00:17:58.050 --> 00:18:02.010
By detaching one Overlay Unit, it gains 500 Attack Points!

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:04.100
Overlay Charge!

00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:10.440
Also due to this effect, my opponent's Monster will lose 1000 ATK!

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:13.320
How could that be? My future...

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:16.450
You aren't the only one who can change the future!

00:18:16.450 --> 00:18:20.410
I can too! No... anyone can! As long as they muster their courage to bring it to 'em!

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:22.950
The future can be changed!

00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:25.700
Go, Hope Ray!

00:18:28.710 --> 00:18:31.840
Hope Sword Chaos Slash!!

00:18:51.520 --> 00:18:54.190
Kotori, sis, it's alright now!

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:57.360
I defeated Shuta and have undone the power of the Number!

00:18:57.900 --> 00:18:58.900
Kotori!

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:00.780
<i>Yuma...</i>

00:19:00.780 --> 00:19:01.740
Sis...

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:05.450
Though that strange power has disappeared, there still is no change inside the blimp!

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:09.670
The height of the blimp is drastically decreasing! If this goes on...

00:19:10.870 --> 00:19:12.920
<i>You can't be serious, Sis!</i>

00:19:14.250 --> 00:19:17.920
Three kilometers behind the airship, there is an unidentified object approaching at high speed!

00:19:18.590 --> 00:19:19.800
We will now switch to the actual image!

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:22.140
That is...

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:24.140
What's happening, sis?

00:19:24.350 --> 00:19:25.890
Yuma, check that out!

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:32.690
Kaito!

00:19:41.240 --> 00:19:42.450
Miss...

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:44.490
It's fine, we are going to be fine.

00:19:56.130 --> 00:19:58.670
What? The velocity of the blimp's decline has decreased!

00:19:59.130 --> 00:20:01.130
The blimp is slowly recovering to the appropriate angle!

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:03.640
Just what is going on here?

00:20:05.510 --> 00:20:07.060
Orbital, full power!

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:08.850
Understood!

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:42.050
Thank god, thank goodness!

00:20:42.130 --> 00:20:43.010
Mama!

00:20:43.180 --> 00:20:44.180
Kotori!

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:48.010
Yuma! Thank you for saving me!

00:20:49.430 --> 00:20:50.930
You should thank Kaito for that.

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:54.730
Kaito!

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:56.610
I owe you one!

00:20:56.860 --> 00:20:59.650
All Duelists are friends after all!

00:21:00.480 --> 00:21:01.990
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:21:02.030 --> 00:21:07.870
If the blimp had fallen and caused a panic in the city, the Duel Carnival might have been canceled.

00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:13.250
Kaito...

00:21:14.790 --> 00:21:15.500
That guy...

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:18.960
Hayami-<i>senpai</i>!

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:22.210
Don't tell me you...!

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:24.260
No... I just instinctively clicked the shutter...

00:21:24.550 --> 00:21:28.930
Umm... Mizuki-<i>san</i>, I am very sorry for letting you experience that hazard.

00:21:29.470 --> 00:21:30.680
I can't believe I actually did that.

00:21:30.970 --> 00:21:31.770
Upperclassman...

00:21:32.270 --> 00:21:35.770
Forget about it. Everyone is safe now. Isn't that a good?

00:21:36.140 --> 00:21:37.150
Yuma-<i>kun</i>...

00:21:39.560 --> 00:21:40.360
Sis...

00:21:40.650 --> 00:21:43.070
Isn't that a good one? Look!

00:21:46.740 --> 00:21:50.120
If you can take such great pictures, you sure don't need Numbers.

00:21:50.830 --> 00:21:52.410
U - Umm... Thank you.

00:21:53.120 --> 00:21:55.580
But would you mind taking a picture of me?

00:21:55.960 --> 00:21:59.380
Imagine my future of me becoming the Duel Champion.

00:21:59.750 --> 00:22:03.090
Don't you decide your own future?

00:22:03.380 --> 00:22:05.010
That's true, isn't it?

00:22:05.510 --> 00:22:07.090
Why are you talking to yourself?

00:22:19.860 --> 00:22:23.020
<i>Someone gave me some water.</i>

00:22:23.400 --> 00:22:28.950
<i>So I was able to paint a rainbow with ease.</i>

00:22:30.070 --> 00:22:34.870
<i>I want to become someone perfect.</i>

00:22:35.660 --> 00:22:37.910
<i>But it's very difficult.</i>

00:22:39.040 --> 00:22:41.500
<i>Even with me suffering,</i>

00:22:41.630 --> 00:22:45.590
<i>I can't seem to grasp victory.</i>

00:22:46.460 --> 00:22:48.380
<i>I want to bloom!</i>

00:22:48.930 --> 00:22:52.850
<i>I must be having some kind of weird dream.</i>

00:22:52.850 --> 00:22:55.890
<i>But If I must fulfill this,</i>

00:22:56.390 --> 00:22:59.190
<i>Then I don't mind being laughed at for it.</i>

00:22:59.350 --> 00:23:06.280
<i>Since it's because your limits are decided on your own.</i>

00:23:06.570 --> 00:23:09.320
<i>I'll show it, overcoming it to tomorrow.</i>

00:23:09.570 --> 00:23:13.780
<i>Ah, I'm aiming for the big blue sky.</i>

00:23:13.990 --> 00:23:15.740
<i>For all of its glory.</i>

00:23:15.740 --> 00:23:17.540
<i>The Freesia of Desire.</i>

00:23:19.290 --> 00:23:22.920
<i>All of those countless flower petals</i>

00:23:23.130 --> 00:23:25.960
<i>They came at the expense of</i>

00:23:26.800 --> 00:23:29.550
<i>me being able to reach those heights.</i>

00:23:29.930 --> 00:23:33.970
<i>Ah, even though I lost my way today,</i>

00:23:34.140 --> 00:23:35.810
<i>I still yearn for it.</i>

00:23:35.810 --> 00:23:38.100
<i>That Freesia of Desire.</i>
